  Background: {fileID: 0}
  narrativeText: You find a can among the clutter in the hallway. Strangely, in this
    apartment building where no one can go outside anymore, the elevator is still
    being used. The number slowly rises from the basement, seeming to stop on every
    floor. Before it reaches your floor, you find yourself inexplicably returning
    to your apartment, shutting the door, and looking through the peephole. The elevator
    arrives. Your neighbors come back smiling brightly, carrying buckets in their
    hands, and the buckets seem much heavier now.
